        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed our pricing strategy to manage the risk/return profile and maximize the long-term economic value of our insured portfolio by balancing credit risk, profitability and volume considerations in light of the current and projected competitive environment.",
